CHANGELOG

05/02/2024:

+ Rewrote install and uninstall scripts to facilitate the installation and reinstallation of the application, with better error handling and logging.
+ Added support for Qt6.
Modifications include:
- Use QOpenGLWidget instead of QGLWidget.
- Use QOpenGLFunctions instead of GLEW.
- Rewrite `GLWidget::display_triangle` to work with `QOpenGLFunctions`.
- Modify `GLWidget::initializeGL` to work with `QOpenGLFunctions` and `QOpenGLBuffer`.
- Modify `GLWidget::GLWidget` to work with `QOpenGLWidget`.
- Modify `main` to work with `QApplication` instead of QGuiApplication.
- Reformat the README to use markdown.
- Add installation instructions for Debian/Ubuntu and Fedora in README.md.